#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:84
msgid ""
"Environment variables are expanded for each individual command (see "
":doc:`/reference/environment-variables`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:85
msgid ""
"Each command is executed in a new shell process, so modifications done to"
" the shell environment do not persist between commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:86
msgid ""
"Any command returning non-zero exit code will cause the build to fail "
"immediately (note there is a special exit code to :doc:`cancel the build "
"</guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds>`)."
