#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:223
msgid "Unshallow git clone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:225
msgid ""
"Read the Docs does not perform a full clone in the ``checkout`` job in "
"order to reduce network data and speed up the build process. Instead, it "
"performs a `shallow clone <https://git-scm.com/docs/shallow>`_ and only "
"fetches the branch or tag that you are building documentation for. "
"Because of this, extensions that depend on the full Git history will "
"fail. To avoid this, it's possible to unshallow the :program:`git clone`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:242
msgid ""
"If your build also relies on the contents of other branches, it may also "
"be necessary to re-configure git to fetch these:"
msgstr ""

